#: src/features/landing/components/FAQSection.tsx
msgid "Ride with Pals eliminates disorganized activities, scattered communication across messaging apps, headaches with selling club merchandise to members, lack of a trusted marketplace for second-hand gear, and manual chaos in member and membership fee management."
